# No .npz in this directory is ever committed.
#
# Deliberately broad. The previous pattern was "*_grids.npz", which was
# correct for the regional grids in front of me at the time and did not
# generalise: imerg_global_week_07-21_07-27.npz slipped through at 21 MB,
# twenty times the entire packed repository, and a weekly file at that
# size would have put roughly 1.1 GB a year into history permanently.
#
# The rule instead of a pattern: raw grids are a refetch-avoidance cache
# and live outside the repo. What gets committed is the DERIVED artifact
# that a published claim rests on, plus the script that regenerates the
# grid from a documented fetch.
*.npz
.screen_cache/
